@startuml
title FastVideoSave - Technical Architecture (Sequence)

actor Visitor as User
participant "Static Frontend\nfastvideosave.net" as Site
participant "Client Script\n(tool.js)" as Tool
participant "Client Crypto\n(AES-CBC)" as Crypto
participant "Media Aggregator API\napi.getrequest.dev" as Agg
participant "Download Proxy CDN\ncdn.turbosave.app" as CDN
participant "Instagram\nMedia Sources" as IG

User -> Site : Paste Instagram video / reel URL
Site -> Tool : onSubmit
Tool -> Crypto : Encrypt target URL
note right of Crypto
  Anti-leech protection for upstream
  aggregator (not Meta authentication)
end note
Crypto --> Tool : Ciphertext for header
Tool -> Agg : Resolve media request
Agg -> Agg : Decrypt / parse request
Agg -> IG : Resolve playable media references
IG --> Agg : Media locations / metadata
Agg --> Tool : JSON with stream URLs
Tool -> CDN : Request downloadable stream
CDN -> IG : Fetch media bytes
IG --> CDN : Binary stream
CDN --> User : MP4 / downloadable output
Site --> User : Ads shown around utility

@enduml
